  "title": {
    "zh": "嵌套循环",
    "en": "Nested Loops"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "外层循环选一排，内层循环给这一排的电池逐块补 3 格。",
    "en": "The outer loop picks a row. The inner loop adds 3 units to each battery in that row."
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "外层选排，内层逐块补电",
    "en": "Outer loop for rows, inner loop for batteries"
  },
  "hints": [],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "外层循环选一排",
        "en": "The outer loop selects a row"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "每进入一轮外层循环，row 就指向新的一排，charged_row 从空列表开始记录这一排的结果。",
        "en": "At the start of each outer turn, row becomes the next row, and charged_row starts empty to hold that row’s results."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "内层循环逐块补电",
        "en": "The inner loop charges one battery at a time"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "内层循环依次取出当前排的电量，每块加 3 格。处理完这一排，保存整排结果，再回到外层换一排。",
        "en": "The inner loop takes each charge in the current row and adds 3. When that row is finished, save its results and return to the outer loop for the next row."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "每排可以有不同块数",
        "en": "Rows can have different lengths"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "一排有几块电池，内层就在这一排补几次。遇到空排时不会补电，仍会记下这一排的空结果。",
        "en": "Each row gets one charging turn per battery. An empty row gets no charging turns, and its empty result is still recorded."
      }
    }
  ],
